build/
# `.dsh/skills/build` is a workflow skill directory, not build output. The
# canonical gate requires every core skill to be tracked (verify-template.sh);
# without this negation the required SKILL.md is invisible to CI and every
# main push fails before the Pages deploy job.
!/.dsh/skills/build/
coverage/
target/
.next/
.turbo/
.vite/
.artifacts/
playwright-report/
test-results/
*.log

